    y&=-px+p
    D&= \left(\frac{p-q}{p+q},\frac{2pq}{p+q}\right).
\end{align*}
Similarly,  $B=CQ\cap AR$  satisfies
\[ B=\left(\frac{q-r}{q+r},\frac{2qr}{q+r}\right).\]
We note that  $E$  is simply the point on line  $BD$  satisfying  $x=0$ . Therfore,
\begin{align*}
