Notice that by label  $1,2 \implies n$  must be odd and it start at the middle of the board
Also consider label  $3$  with type  $1,2$  operation make the sum invariant
But operation  $3 :$  sum  $-2$  , operation  $4 :$  sum  $+2$ .
