[/asy]
---------------------------
Now let  $P'=RE\cap CF$ . By the Lemma  $P'Q\parallel AR$ . It is immediate that triangles  $EAP$  and  $EHP'$  are similar by pairwise perpendicular sides. Thus by simple ratios we also have that triangles  $EPQ$  and  $ERH$  are similar. Since  $EH\perp EQ$  it must also be that  $RH\perp PQ$ , as desired.

