<span style="color:#0B5394">*Proof*</span>: This follows by noting that  $\angle MEA=\angle MAE=\angle EAN$  by claim- $1$  which implies  $AN||ME$  and similarly,  $AM ||NF$ .  $\square$ <span style="color:#0B5394">**Claim**</span>:  $BMNX$  is an isosceles trapezoid.
