1.  $\deg F \leq 2048$ ;
2. the coefficients of  $F(x,y)$  are  $0$  and  $1$ ;
3.  $F(x,0)=F(0,y)\equiv 0$ ;
4.  $F(x+z,y)+F(z,y)+F(x,y+z)+F(x,z)$  has all of its coefficients being even.

